 ('Gallery visit',[('Visitor','What did you think of the show?','O que achou da exposição?'),('Critic','Arresting, though some pieces feel derivative.','Impressionante, embora algumas peças pareçam derivativas.'),('Visitor','Is it worth a second visit?','Vale uma segunda visita?'),('Critic','It repays one, certainly.','Compensa, com certeza.')]),
 [('Praise a work precisely.','Elogie.','The palette is luminous and restrained.'),('Make a fair criticism.','Critique.','The catalogue feels laboured.'),('Recommend with reservation.','Recomende.','Worth seeing, despite its uneven middle.')],
